<% content_for :title, "About SnippetBox — Free Code Snippet & File Sharing Tool" %>
<% content_for :description, "SnippetBox is a free pastebin alternative with Markdown rendering, syntax highlighting for 20+ languages, and file uploads. No account required. Share code snippets and files instantly." %>

<section class="about-page">
  <h1>About SnippetBox</h1>

  <p>
    SnippetBox is a free, open-source tool for sharing code snippets and files instantly —
    no account, no login, no friction. Paste your code, get a short URL, share it with anyone.
  </p>

  <h2>Why SnippetBox?</h2>
  <p>
    Most code sharing tools either require you to create an account or strip away formatting.
    SnippetBox gives you <strong>Markdown rendering with live syntax highlighting</strong> and
    <strong>file uploads</strong> in one place, completely anonymously.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>No account required</strong> — create and share in seconds</li>
    <li><strong>Markdown support</strong> — write formatted content with headings, lists, tables, and code blocks</li>
    <li><strong>Syntax highlighting</strong> for Ruby, JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, Go, Rust, SQL, and 15+ more languages</li>
    <li><strong>File uploads</strong> — attach up to 5 files (5MB each) alongside your snippet</li>
    <li><strong>Custom URLs</strong> — choose a memorable slug or get a random short link</li>
    <li><strong>Automatic expiration</strong> — shares expire after your chosen time (1 hour to never)</li>
    <li><strong>Fork & edit</strong> — copy any share and make it your own</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Write your content using Markdown — code blocks, headings, links, and more</li>
    <li>Optionally upload files (PDFs, images, spreadsheets, source files)</li>
    <li>Choose a custom URL or let SnippetBox generate a short one</li>
    <li>Share the link — your snippet is immediately available, no account needed</li>
    <li>Edit your share within 30 days using the edit cookie stored in your browser</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Privacy & Data</h2>
  <p>
    SnippetBox stores only what you share: your text content, uploaded files, and an edit token
    (saved as a browser cookie) that lets you update your share. Shares automatically expire
    and are permanently deleted after your chosen duration.
  </p>

